<!-- Ecosystem Hero -->
<div class="eco-hero">
  <div class="eco-hero-inner">
    <div class="section-label">The Cat Ilacad Universe</div>
    <h1>One Vision.<br>Many Businesses.</h1>
    <p>Every brand Cat has built is proof that her systems work — and an invitation to see what's possible when you stop winging it.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Ecosystem Intro -->
<section class="eco-intro">
  <div class="eco-intro-inner">
    <p class="eco-intro-lead">Cat Ilacad didn't build one business. She built an ecosystem.</p>
    <p>From a single nail salon launched in the early 2000s to a portfolio of thriving brands spanning beauty, community, and entrepreneurship education — every business Cat has founded lives in the same ecosystem, powered by the same philosophy: <strong>build systems that let your business run without you.</strong></p>
    <p>Each brand you see here is a living proof of that method. They operate. They grow. They serve their communities — without Cat micromanaging every detail. That's what the CEO Systems Method is built on. Not theory. Not templates. <em>Real businesses, already running.</em></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Business Cards -->
<section class="eco-grid-section">
  <div class="eco-grid">

    <!-- Posh Nails -->
    <div class="eco-card">
      <div class="eco-card-header eco-card-header--posh-nails">
        <div class="eco-card-logo-wrap">
          <img
            src="https://poshnailsph.com/cdn/shop/files/Screen_Shot_2022-07-12_at_11.56.00_AM-removebg-preview.png?v=1657598362"
            alt="Posh Nails"
            class="eco-card-logo eco-card-logo--posh-nails"
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="eco-card-body">
        <div class="eco-card-tag">Where It All Began</div>
        <h2 class="eco-card-name">Posh Nails</h2>
        <p class="eco-card-desc">The original. Cat founded Posh Nails as a young entrepreneur with everything to prove — and built it into one of the most recognized nail care brands in the Philippines. Today, Posh Nails runs on the very systems Cat now teaches, serving clients across multiple locations with a team that doesn't need Cat in the room to deliver excellence.</p>
        <div class="eco-card-links">
          <a href="https://poshnailsph.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="eco-link eco-link--web">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
