          </a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/poshnails_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="eco-link eco-link--ig" aria-label="Posh Nails on Instagram">
            <svg class="eco-ig-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
            @poshnails_
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Posh Beauty Studio -->
    <div class="eco-card">
      <div class="eco-card-header eco-card-header--posh-beauty">
        <div class="eco-card-icon-brand">
          <svg class="eco-brand-ig-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
          <span class="eco-brand-name-display">Posh Beauty Studio</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="eco-card-body">
        <div class="eco-card-tag">Beauty Elevated</div>
        <h2 class="eco-card-name">Posh Beauty Studio</h2>
        <p class="eco-card-desc">The premium sister brand to Posh Nails, Posh Beauty Studio is where beauty meets intention. Offering curated beauty services and an elevated studio experience, it carries the same commitment to excellence that Cat has embedded into every brand she touches — beautifully delivered, systematically run.</p>
        <div class="eco-card-links">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/theposhbeautystudio/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="eco-link eco-link--ig" aria-label="Posh Beauty Studio on Instagram">
            <svg class="eco-ig-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
            @theposhbeautystudio
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Leading Ladies -->
    <div class="eco-card">
      <div class="eco-card-header eco-card-header--leading-ladies">
        <div class="eco-card-logo-wrap">
          <img
            src="https://leadingladies.ph/cdn/shop/files/logo.png?v=1737909422"
            alt="Leading Ladies"
            class="eco-card-logo eco-card-logo--leading-ladies"
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="eco-card-body">
        <div class="eco-card-tag">Community & Leadership</div>
        <h2 class="eco-card-name">Leading Ladies</h2>
        <p class="eco-card-desc">A movement for women who lead. Leading Ladies is Cat's community brand — a space built for female entrepreneurs, founders, and creators in the Philippines to inspire each other, sharpen their skills, and rise together. Through power panels, workshops, and the Ladies' League, it's proof that Cat's ecosystem doesn't just build businesses — it builds leaders.</p>
        <div class="eco-card-links">
          <a href="https://leadingladies.ph/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="eco-link eco-link--web">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
            leadingladies.ph
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ladiesletslead" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="eco-link eco-link--ig" aria-label="Leading Ladies on Instagram">
            <svg class="eco-ig-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
            @ladiesletslead
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Dear Sundays -->
    <div class="eco-card">
      <div class="eco-card-header eco-card-header--dear-sundays">
        <div class="eco-card-icon-brand">
          <svg class="eco-brand-ig-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
          <span class="eco-brand-name-display">Dear Sundays</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="eco-card-body">
        <div class="eco-card-tag">Lifestyle & Intention</div>
        <h2 class="eco-card-name">Dear Sundays</h2>
        <p class="eco-card-desc">Dear Sundays is the softer side of Cat's world — a lifestyle brand rooted in slowness, intention, and the art of enjoying what you've built. Because at the end of all the systems and strategy, the whole point is a life worth living. Dear Sundays is a reminder of why you're building your business in the first place.</p>
        <div class="eco-card-links">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/dearsundaysph" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="eco-link eco-link--ig" aria-label="Dear Sundays on Instagram">
            <svg class="eco-ig-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
            @dearsundaysph
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- Closing CTA -->
<section class="eco-cta">
  <div class="eco-cta-inner">
    <div class="eco-cta-text">
      <p class="eco-cta-eyebrow">Want to build your own ecosystem?</p>
      <h2>The method behind all of this is something you can learn.</h2>
      <p>Every brand you just read about runs on the same four systems Cat built — and now teaches. If Cat can build and sustain multiple thriving businesses, you can absolutely build one that doesn't need you every second of every day.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="eco-cta-actions">
      <a href="/#course" class="btn-primary eco-cta-btn">Explore the CEO Systems Method</a>
      <a href="/pages/about" class="eco-cta-link">Learn more about Cat →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% content_for "blocks" %}

<style>
  /* ── Hero ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .eco-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--charcoal) 0%, #5a2d44 100%);
    padding: 6rem 2rem 5rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  .eco-hero-inner { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .eco-hero .section-label {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(196,116,138,0.25);
    color: var(--sand);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .eco-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .eco-hero p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: rgba(253,248,249,0.8);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── Intro ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .eco-intro { padding: 5rem 2rem; background: var(--cream); }
  .eco-intro-inner { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .eco-intro-lead {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .eco-intro p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--warm-gray);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }
  .eco-intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .eco-intro strong { color: var(--charcoal); }
  .eco-intro em { color: var(--terracotta); font-style: italic; }

  /* ── Grid ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .eco-grid-section { padding: 5rem 2rem; background: var(--sand); }
  .eco-grid {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .eco-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  /* ── Card ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .eco-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(61,31,46,0.08);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }
  .eco-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(61,31,46,0.14);
  }

  /* Card headers — each brand gets its own accent */
  .eco-card-header {
    height: 160px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .eco-card-header--posh-nails    { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #2d2d2d 100%); }
  .eco-card-header--posh-beauty   { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c8a0b4 0%, #e8c4d4 100%); }
  .eco-card-header--leading-ladies { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c2c4e 0%, #4a4a7a 100%); }
  .eco-card-header--dear-sundays  { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4956a 0%, #e8b898 100%); }

  /* Logo images */
  .eco-card-logo-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 100%; }
  .eco-card-logo { max-height: 70px; max-width: 200px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; }
  .eco-card-logo--posh-nails { filter: brightness(0) invert(1); }
  .eco-card-logo--leading-ladies { filter: brightness(0) invert(1); }

  /* Icon-only brand display (Instagram-primary brands) */
  .eco-card-icon-brand {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }
  .eco-brand-ig-icon {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    color: white;
    opacity: 0.92;
  }
  .eco-brand-name-display {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: white;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Card body */
  .eco-card-body { padding: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }
  .eco-card-tag {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .eco-card-name {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .eco-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--warm-gray);
    line-height: 1.75;
    flex: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Links */
  .eco-card-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.65rem; margin-top: auto; }
  .eco-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .eco-link--web {
    background: var(--sand);
    color: var(--charcoal);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(196,116,138,0.25);
  }
  .eco-link--web:hover { background: var(--terracotta); color: white; border-color: var(--terracotta); }
  .eco-link--ig {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #833ab4, #fd1d1d, #fcb045);
    color: white;
    border: none;
  }
  .eco-link--ig:hover { opacity: 0.88; transform: scale(1.03); }
  .eco-ig-icon { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* ── Closing CTA ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .eco-cta { padding: 6rem 2rem; background: var(--cream); }
  .eco-cta-inner {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .eco-cta-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
    .eco-cta-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  }
  .eco-cta-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .eco-cta-text h2 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.1rem);
    color: var(--charcoal);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .eco-cta-text p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--warm-gray);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .eco-cta-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start; }
  .eco-cta-btn {
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .eco-cta-link {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .eco-cta-link:hover { color: var(--terracotta-deep); }
</style>

